  "copyright_text": "©2025 Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. HB Studios and the HB Studios logo are trademarks of Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. All rights reserved. The PGA TOUR and TPC names and logos are registered trademarks and used under license from PGA TOUR. All other marks are property of their respective owners. All rights reserved.",
